# Line endings are LF in the tree, on every platform.
#
# Added 2026-09-10 after a scripted edit on Windows rewrote twelve source files
# to CRLF and committed them, turning eleven-line changes into whole-file
# diffs. core.autocrlf is false here, so without this git stores whatever the
# editor or script happened to write.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
